 "provenance": "Bavaria 4 (w1 l3) normal exit 36,6, control-only on the exact S700 core. Start: lives 12 (campaign-style value used by earlier routes), weaponTier 2 (hook obtained in Bavaria 3 chest 24,25), maxHealth 4, 0 diamonds. The magic diamond lock tile (35,6, 45 diamonds) is cleared at load in this S700 build (method_296 case 12, the level-load object scan), as in Bavaria 3. Route: first 480 ticks replay the intent of the old port attempt bavaria-04-first-stone-wall (hook pulls through the stone block at 8-10,5-7, checkpoint 3,6); hook pull of stone 17,9 from 15,9 (the column-17 stones drop), then three pushes move stone 16,6 to 19,6, where it drops into 19,7; the three red snakes on row 7 (25-27) are killed with timed hammer hits (3 hits each, each landing as the previous stun ends); upper loop via column 28, row 2 and column 34 to checkpoint 30,10; hook from 26,10 pulls stone 24,10, which falls down column 25 and crushes the three green snakes; checkpoint 19,16; hammer on brick 13,15 breaks the brick row so roller 13,14 drops first into pocket 14,19 and roller 17,14 then rolls left along row 18 and destroys crusher 10,17-18; timed dashes past the spike traps on row 18; column 2 down; bottom-left: diamond 2,24 taken and the hero steps back so stone 3,23 rolls to 2,24; through 4,23 and the chest 6,24; grass 8,24 hammered (stone 8,23 drops), hook from 7,23 pulls stone 9,23 to 8,23 and it rolls off to 7,24, opening 9,23-9,22; grass on rows 21-23 cut from the side under rollers 12,20 14,21 16,22 so they drop clear; checkpoint 18,24; stone 20,20 hooked into column 21, hooked again from 24,23 to 23,23 and pushed onto plate 24,24 (gate 27,24 opens); riddle room 0 (trigger 30,25, checkpoint 31,25): green snake hooked to column 32 and crushed by stone 33,23, red snake hooked to column 37 and crushed by stone 36,23, gates reopen; out by 39,25 and column 40 to row 20; climbing grass column 33 lets stone 32,19 roll into column 33 so 32,18 empties; checkpoint 32,13; from 32,9 stone 31,9 pushed into column 30, then two hook pulls from 31,9 drag stones 34,9 out (they fall down column 32), emptying 34,6-7; stone 33,6 pushed into column 34 and the hero walks to the exit. No damage taken, no deaths, no resets.",
